この位相を変化させることができます。実は、移相器と鏡とビームスプリッタさえあれば、単一光子の伝播経路に符号化されたクーディット(qudit)に対して、任意のユニタリ操作を実装できるのです。","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":183,"offset":4378},"end":{"line":31,"column":917,"offset":5112}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1,"offset":4196},"end":{"line":31,"column":917,"offset":5112}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"center","attributes":[],"children":[{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"Image","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"image-6gqyng","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":8,"offset":5130},"end":{"line":34,"column":27,"offset":5149}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"width","value":"300px","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":28,"offset":5150},"end":{"line":34,"column":41,"offset":5163}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"defaultValue","value":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/Glan-taylor.png","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":42,"offset":5164},"end":{"line":34,"column":124,"offset":5246}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1,"offset":5123},"end":{"line":34,"column":127,"offset":5249}},"data":{"_mdxExplicitJsx":true}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"(出典: Wikipedia)","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":2,"offset":5252},"end":{"line":36,"column":21,"offset":5271}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1,"offset":5251},"end":{"line":36,"column":22,"offset":5272}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1,"offset":5251},"end":{"line":36,"column":22,"offset":5272}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1,"offset":5114},"end":{"line":37,"column":10,"offset":5282}},"data":{"_mdxExplicitJsx":true}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"私たちの周りには光があふれていますが、量子コンピューティングに適した性質を持つ単一光子を得るのは容易ではありません。単一光子には特別な光源があり、その多くは特殊な結晶中の非線形光学過程に基づいています。生成された単一光子は、一連の光学素子によってさまざまな操作を受け、最後に、非常に高感度な単一光子検出器で検出されます。この検出は、光子の状態の単なる読み出しではありません。むしろ計算そのものの不可欠な構成要素と見なすことができ、光子の検出を量子計算の能動的な一部として利用する多くの手法があります。","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1,"offset":5284},"end":{"line":39,"column":706,"offset":5989}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1,"offset":5284},"end":{"line":39,"column":706,"offset":5989}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"光学ゲート","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":5,"offset":5995},"end":{"line":41,"column":18,"offset":6008}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1,"offset":5991},"end":{"line":41,"column":18,"offset":6008}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"前節で述べた光学素子は低レベルすぎるため、より高度な光子操作には通常それだけでは不十分です。そのため、通常はフォトニックゲートを単位としてアルゴリズムを設計します。これらのゲートは、いくつかの光学素子からなる小さな光学セットアップであり、多くの場合、光子検出器で補完されます。フォトニックゲートの代表例は、2つのタイプがあるフュージョンゲートです","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1,"offset":6010},"end":{"line":43,"column":408,"offset":6417}}},{"type":"footnoteReference","identifier":"1","label":"1","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":408,"offset":6417},"end":{"line":43,"column":412,"offset":6421}}},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":412,"offset":6421},"end":{"line":43,"column":413,"offset":6422}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1,"offset":6010},"end":{"line":43,"column":413,"offset":6422}}},{"type":"footnoteDefinition","identifier":"1","label":"1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Browne, Daniel E., and Terry Rudolph. “Resource-Efficient Linear Optical Quantum Computation.” Physical Review Letters, vol. 95, no. 1, June 2005, p. 010501. APS, ","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":7,"offset":6430},"end":{"line":45,"column":170,"offset":6593}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.95.010501","children":[{"type":"text","value":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.95.010501","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":171,"offset":6594},"end":{"line":45,"column":216,"offset":6639}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":170,"offset":6593},"end":{"line":45,"column":264,"offset":6687}}},